ike a cracked whip in the stale air of Western politics. \u201cAs unacceptable as they are stupid.\u201d The target was not immigration policy, but a lie \u2014 the claim, amplified by Donald Trump and a chorus of right-wing figures, that Muslim migrants had set France alight. The protests that swept Paris, Lyon and Marseille were not a civilisational invasion. They were a cry about grocery bills, overcrowded classrooms and a state that had cut 4,000 teaching posts while fuel prices climbed. Macron\u2019s fury was therefore more than a defence of immigrants. It was a rejection of the most durable political technology of the age: the conversion of economic failure into cultural panic. The mechanics are almost [\u2026]", "content": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PAID PLANS", "keywords": ["asia & americas", "slides", "opinion", "canada", "france", "us", "europe & russia", "middle east", "palestine", "article"], "creator": ["editormehdi"], "language": "english", "country": ["israel", "united arab emirates", "iran", "turkey", "lebanon", "syria", "palestine", "iraq", "united kingdom", "egypt"], "category": ["world"], "datatype": "news", "pubDate": "2026-10-22 13:25:27", "pubDateTZ": "UTC", "fetched_at": "2026-10-22 13:35:34", "image_url": "https://www.middleeastmonitor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AA-20261013-42743469-42743461-EMMANUEL_MACRON_MAHAMAT_IDRISS_DEBY_MEETING_IN_PARIS.jpg", "video_url": null, "source_id": "middleeastmonitor", "source_name": "Middle East Monitor", "source_priority": 24616, "source_url": "https://www.middleeastmonitor.com", "source_icon": "https://i.newsdata.io/middleeastmonitor.png", "sentiment": "positive", "sentiment_stats": {"negative": 12.89, "neutral": 23.73, "positive": 63.38}, "ai_tag": ["politics"], "ai_region": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN CORPORATE PLANS", "ai_org": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN CORPORATE PLANS", "ai_summary": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PAID PLANS", "duplicate": false}, {"article_id": "278ffaf8c56a3b0b0445fc18573d3aa8", "link": "https://www.elbalad.news/715